  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "20aff679-2cd0-b0ce-ad5a-e60b4c5834c8",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "d8be1355-211c-b10c-3a66-0ec0847312c5",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I'm very happy with this recognition of my PhD work. It's especially nice to see this kind of historical research appreciated by an organisation that does not limit itself to my field of study (Mamluk studies, or even Islamic history) but tries to connect people across Islamic studies. In a way that resonates nicely with AKU-ISMC's own mission.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Gowaart will be turning his dissertation into a monograph and enrich it by including data from his ongoing work in the KITAB project.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
